      "writtenOn": "2021-06-16T00:54:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "is this value being properly accounted when the device is in a low-power state?\n\nIn a \"screen off\" state, system thresholds should be ignored, but app thresholds should be honored IF they have requested this specifically... Thus, in low-power, the thresholds that are system-only should be disabled.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4047,
        "startChar": 74,
        "endLine": 4047,
        "endChar": 92
      },
      "revId": "9efd3d5fefdd7a13b31eb5ca4417e602d7f4b365",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
